        <item>
            <title>2.12.0</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 06 Aug 2026 11:57:07 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>81</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.12.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Features

- **Drag a sidebar row to reorder the panes.** The open block now reads as a map of the pane strip: highlighted rows top-to-bottom are the panes left-to-right. Drag a session to move its pane; the row stays where you dropped it and the panes follow.
- **Cmd+click an open session to give it its own pane, positioned where its row is.** Cmd+click the top row and the pane opens leftmost. Previously a new pane always appeared at the right end regardless of where the row sat.
- **Clicking a session into a pane pulls its row to that pane's position**, so the sidebar keeps matching the panes. Re-selecting a session that already has a pane still moves nothing.

### Changes

- Pane-membership highlighting is now a rounded chip per row instead of a full-width bar, so adjacent panes read as separate rows. Hovering a highlighted row deepens it rather than replacing the highlight.
- The sidebar animates row reordering over 0.2s. Panes themselves are deliberately not animated, which keeps chat scroll positions from drifting.
- Pane widths travel with the session when panes reorder, so the window never resizes and no chat view reloads.

### Bug Fixes

- The session recap no longer renders underneath the extension's notice banners (Remote Control, rate-limit warnings, MCP notices, settings errors). It now sits at the top of the composer where it is always visible.
]]></description>
